 },
 "html": "<h2 id=\"secao-9-1\">9.1 Componentes de data e duração</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> extrai partes da data (ano, mês, dia da semana) e calcula intervalos entre duas datas.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> sempre que houver colunas de data. Elas precisam estar como <code>datetime64</code> (conversão na Seção <a href=\"/preparar/limpeza-e-tratamento/#secao-4-2\">4.2</a>).</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ano</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].dt.year</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].dt.month                  <span class=\"tk-com\"># número: ordena corretamente</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mes_nome</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].dt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">month_name</span>()      <span class=\"tk-com\"># nome: bom para rótulos</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">dia_semana</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].dt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">day_name</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ano_mes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].dt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_period</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">M</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)     <span class=\"tk-com\"># período mensal (ex.: 2024-03)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">duracao</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data_fim</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] - df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]   <span class=\"tk-com\"># Timedelta</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">duracao_dias</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">duracao</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].dt.days                  <span class=\"tk-com\"># número de dias (int), para cálculos e gráficos</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">df[[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data_fim</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ano</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mes_nome</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">dia_semana</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ano_mes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">duracao_dias</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]].<span class=\"tk-fn\">head</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_data</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_data_fim</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">ano</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">mes</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">mes_nome</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">dia_semana</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">ano_mes</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">duracao_dias</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td>2024-10-06</td>\n<td>2024-10-20</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2024</td>\n<td class=\"num\">10</td>\n<td>October</td>\n<td>Sunday</td>\n<td>2024-10</td>\n<td class=\"num\">14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1</th>\n<td>2024-09-02</td>\n<td>2024-09-12</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2024</td>\n<td class=\"num\">9</td>\n<td>September</td>\n<td>Monday</td>\n<td>2024-09</td>\n<td class=\"num\">10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">2</th>\n<td>2024-12-03</td>\n<td>2024-12-10</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2024</td>\n<td class=\"num\">12</td>\n<td>December</td>\n<td>Tuesday</td>\n<td>2024-12</td>\n<td class=\"num\">7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">3</th>\n<td>2024-10-01</td>\n<td>2024-10-03</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2024</td>\n<td class=\"num\">10</td>\n<td>October</td>\n<td>Tuesday</td>\n<td>2024-10</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">4</th>\n<td>2024-06-24</td>\n<td>2024-06-29</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2024</td>\n<td class=\"num\">6</td>\n<td>June</td>\n<td>Monday</td>\n<td>2024-06</td>\n<td class=\"num\">5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li>Agrupar por <code>mes_nome</code> ordena os meses <strong>alfabeticamente</strong> (April, August, ...). Agrupe por <code>mes</code> ou <code>ano_mes</code> e use o nome só como rótulo.</li>\n<li><code>dt.month_name(locale='pt_BR.UTF-8')</code> retorna os nomes em português, se o sistema tiver esse locale instalado.</li>\n<li>Durações negativas indicam datas invertidas ou erro de registro.</li>\n<li>Para médias de duração, use <code>duracao_dias</code> (número). A média de um <code>Timedelta</code> funciona, mas é menos legível.</li>\n</ul></div></aside>\n<h2 id=\"secao-9-2\">9.2 Evolução no tempo</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> agrega a métrica por período (contagem, soma, média) e plota a série.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> para identificar tendência, sazonalidade, picos e quedas.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">serie_mensal = (df</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">groupby</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ano_mes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    .<span class=\"tk-fn\">agg</span>(n=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">count</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>), total=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_valor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">sum</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>), media=(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mean</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">serie_mensal[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">media_movel_3m</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = serie_mensal[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">total</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">rolling</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">3</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>()   <span class=\"tk-com\"># suaviza oscilações</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">fig, ax = plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">subplots</span>(figsize=(<span class=\"tk-num\">12</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">serie_mensal[[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">total</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">media_movel_3m</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]].<span class=\"tk-fn\">plot</span>(ax=ax, marker=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">o</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_title</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Total mensal de coluna_valor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_xlabel</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Gráfico de linhas com marcadores do total mensal de coluna_valor e da média móvel de 3 meses ao longo de 2024. Título: Total mensal de coluna_valor.\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Gráfico de linhas com marcadores do total mensal de coluna_valor e da média móvel de 3 meses ao longo de 2024. Título: Total mensal de coluna_valor.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"610\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/notebook/celula-168.webp\" width=\"1549\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># Alternativa com a data como índice: resample agrupa por frequência ('D', 'W', 'MS', 'QS', 'YS')</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_index</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_valor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">resample</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">MS</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">sum</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">head</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">coluna_data\n2024-01-01   215,495.10\n2024-02-01   193,835.41\n2024-03-01   202,372.88\n2024-04-01   199,758.32\n2024-05-01   164,490.77\nFreq: MS, Name: coluna_valor, dtype: float64</pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-9-3\">9.3 Sazonalidade: período × categoria</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> cruza o período (mês, dia da semana) com outra dimensão em um heatmap.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> para encontrar padrões recorrentes (meses de pico, dias fracos).</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">ordem_dias = [<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Monday</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Tuesday</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Wednesday</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Thursday</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Friday</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Saturday</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Sunday</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">pivot_tempo = (df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">pivot_table</span>(values=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, index=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">dia_semana</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, columns=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, aggfunc=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">count</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">                 .<span class=\"tk-fn\">reindex</span>(ordem_dias))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">fig, ax = plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">subplots</span>(figsize=(<span class=\"tk-num\">12</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">heatmap</span>(pivot_tempo, cmap=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">YlGnBu</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, annot=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>, fmt=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.0f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, ax=ax)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_title</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Registros por dia da semana × mês</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Mapa de calor com a contagem de registros por dia da semana (linhas, de segunda a domingo) e mês (colunas), com os valores anotados. Título: Registros por dia da semana × mês.\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Mapa de calor com a contagem de registros por dia da semana (linhas, de segunda a domingo) e mês (colunas), com os valores anotados. Título: Registros por dia da semana × mês.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"621\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/notebook/celula-171.webp\" width=\"1473\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li>Períodos incompletos (o mês atual, o primeiro mês da base) parecem quedas, mas não são. Confira as datas mínima e máxima: <code>df['coluna_data'].agg(['min', 'max'])</code>.</li>\n<li>Compare períodos equivalentes (mês contra o mesmo mês do ano anterior) quando houver sazonalidade.</li>\n</ul></div></aside>\n<h2 id=\"secao-9-4\">9.4 Variação entre períodos <span class=\"selo selo--complemento\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\" title=\"Técnica que não estava no material de estudo original\">Complemento</span></h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> compara cada período com o anterior (<strong>mês a mês</strong>, MoM), com o mesmo período do ano anterior (<strong>ano a ano</strong>, YoY) e calcula o <strong>acumulado no ano</strong> (YTD).</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> em qualquer acompanhamento de indicador. A variação diz se o resultado melhorou ou piorou, e o valor absoluto sozinho não diz.</p>\n<div aria-label=\"Quando usar:\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Medida</th>\n<th>Código</th>\n<th>Pergunta</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Variação % sobre o período anterior</td>\n<td><code>.pct_change()</code></td>\n<td>cresceu em relação ao mês passado?</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Variação % sobre 12 períodos antes</td>\n<td><code>.pct_change(12)</code></td>\n<td>cresceu em relação ao mesmo mês do ano anterior?</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Diferença absoluta</td>\n<td><code>.diff()</code></td>\n<td>quanto mudou, na unidade original?</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Valor do período anterior</td>\n<td><code>.shift()</code></td>\n<td>base para cálculos próprios</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Acumulado</td>\n<td><code>.cumsum()</code> (por ano: <code>groupby(ano).cumsum()</code>)</td>\n<td>quanto já foi realizado no ano?</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">receita_mensal = (eventos[eventos[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_etapa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] == <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">etapa_3</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">                  .<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_index</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data_evento</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_valor_pedido</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">                  .<span class=\"tk-fn\">resample</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">MS</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">sum</span>()               <span class=\"tk-com\"># garante todos os meses, inclusive os sem venda</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">                  .<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_frame</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">receita</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">receita_mensal[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">var_mom</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = receita_mensal[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">receita</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">pct_change</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">receita_mensal[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">var_yoy</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = receita_mensal[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">receita</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">pct_change</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">12</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">receita_mensal[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">dif_mom</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = receita_mensal[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">receita</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">diff</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">receita_mensal[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">acumulado_ano</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = receita_mensal.<span class=\"tk-fn\">groupby</span>(receita_mensal.index.year)[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">receita</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">cumsum</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">receita_mensal.<span class=\"tk-fn\">tail</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">12</span>)   <span class=\"tk-com\"># var_mom e var_yoy em fração: 0.05 = +5%</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">receita</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">var_mom</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">var_yoy</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">dif_mom</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">acumulado_ano</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_data_evento</th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">2024-01-01</th>\n<td class=\"num\">21,217.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.05</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2.88</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-1,010.82</td>\n<td class=\"num\">21,217.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">2024-02-01</th>\n<td class=\"num\">16,509.31</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.22</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.69</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-4,707.69</td>\n<td class=\"num\">37,726.31</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">2024-03-01</th>\n<td class=\"num\">22,056.79</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.34</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.44</td>\n<td class=\"num\">5,547.48</td>\n<td class=\"num\">59,783.10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">2024-04-01</th>\n<td class=\"num\">21,240.79</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.04</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.36</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-816.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">81,023.89</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">2024-05-01</th>\n<td class=\"num\">24,134.82</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.14</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.07</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2,894.03</td>\n<td class=\"num\">105,158.71</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">2024-06-01</th>\n<td class=\"num\">22,811.11</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.05</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.18</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-1,323.71</td>\n<td class=\"num\">127,969.82</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">2024-07-01</th>\n<td class=\"num\">22,237.87</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.03</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.07</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-573.24</td>\n<td class=\"num\">150,207.69</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">2024-08-01</th>\n<td class=\"num\">19,461.50</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.12</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.03</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-2,776.37</td>\n<td class=\"num\">169,669.19</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">2024-09-01</th>\n<td class=\"num\">17,384.66</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.11</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.21</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-2,076.84</td>\n<td class=\"num\">187,053.85</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">2024-10-01</th>\n<td class=\"num\">16,816.17</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.03</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.21</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-568.49</td>\n<td class=\"num\">203,870.02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">2024-11-01</th>\n<td class=\"num\">19,208.08</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.14</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.20</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2,391.91</td>\n<td class=\"num\">223,078.10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">2024-12-01</th>\n<td class=\"num\">12,660.48</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.34</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.43</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-6,547.60</td>\n<td class=\"num\">235,738.58</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># Comparativo ano contra ano: meses nas linhas, anos nas colunas</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">comparativo = receita_mensal.<span class=\"tk-fn\">pivot_table</span>(index=receita_mensal.index.month,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">                                         columns=receita_mensal.index.year, values=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">receita</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">comparativo.index.name = <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">ano_atual, ano_anterior = comparativo.columns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">max</span>(), comparativo.columns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">max</span>() - <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">comparativo[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">var_yoy</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = comparativo[ano_atual] / comparativo[ano_anterior] - <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">fig, axes = plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">subplots</span>(ncols=<span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>, figsize=(<span class=\"tk-num\">15</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">comparativo[[ano_anterior, ano_atual]].<span class=\"tk-fn\">plot</span>(ax=axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>], marker=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">o</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_title</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Receita mensal: ano atual × ano anterior</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">legend</span>(title=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ano</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">receita_mensal[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">acumulado_ano</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">plot</span>(ax=axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_title</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Receita acumulada no ano (reinicia em janeiro)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Dois gráficos de linhas: à esquerda, receita mensal do ano atual contra a do ano anterior, mês a mês; à direita, receita acumulada no ano, que reinicia em janeiro.\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Dois gráficos de linhas: à esquerda, receita mensal do ano atual contra a do ano anterior, mês a mês; à direita, receita acumulada no ano, que reinicia em janeiro.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"651\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/notebook/celula-175.webp\" width=\"1863\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li><code>pct_change(12)</code> só equivale a \"ano a ano\" se a série tiver <strong>todos os meses</strong>, sem lacunas. Por isso a série foi montada com <code>resample('MS')</code>.</li>\n<li>Variações percentuais sobre bases pequenas parecem enormes (de 10 para 30 = +200%). Reporte sempre o valor absoluto junto da variação.</li>\n<li>Não compare um período <strong>incompleto</strong> (mês corrente) com um completo. Para o ano corrente, compare o acumulado até o mesmo mês do ano anterior.</li>\n<li>O início de uma base (por exemplo, o primeiro ano de operação) costuma mostrar crescimento artificial. Com sazonalidade, prefira YoY a MoM.</li>\n</ul></div></aside>\n",
